SPECIAL NOTE FOR DISASTER RESPONSE USE:

This software is developed with the intention of saving lives during 
emergency situations and natural disasters. Organizations involved in 
disaster response (AFAD, Red Crescent, WHO, emergency services, etc.) 
are especially encouraged to use, modify, and deploy this software 
without any restrictions.

If you use MESH112 in a real disaster scenario or for emergency 
preparedness training, please let us know at team@mesh112.org so we 
can celebrate the impact together and improve the platform based on 
real-world feedback.

🇹🇷 Afet anında her telefon bir umut, her bağlantı bir hayat.
🌍 In disasters, every phone is hope, every connection is life.
